<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Bivec year shr, div rises.</title>
<headline>Bivec year shr, div rises.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		  104.1	 vs 85.8</p>
<p>    - headline		97.4	  vs 82.1</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 24.5	  vs 23.5</p>
